  "cases": [
    "discards only paused metrics and preserves hardware liveness",
    "resets the meter baseline, keeps old totals and marks the resumed day incomplete",
    "pausing AI allows tariff changes without resetting the configured analysis preference",
    "invalidates parking observations and waits for a fresh sample after reactivation",
    "feature pause cancels queued gate commands and reactivation never resends them",
    "pause waits for an in-flight publish and still accepts its acknowledgement",
    "alert delivery serializes with pause and old alerts are not delivered afterwards",
    "support blocks new launches and keeps the result of an existing request recordable"
  ],
